OL,3,GNEWSABat tunnel built under new dual
OL,4,Acarriageway
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tunnel has been built beneath a new
OL,7,Fdual carriageway to provide a safe
OL,8,Froute for bats and other local
OL,9,Fwildlife.
OL,11,FThe 45m-long (148ft) crossing runs
OL,12,Funder the new 10-mile (16km) A421 road,
OL,13,Fbetween Black Cat roundabout, in
OL,14,FChawston on the outskirts of Bedford,
OL,15,Fand Caxton Gibbet roundabout, in
OL,16,FCaxton, near Cambridge.
OL,18,FNational Highways said ecological
OL,19,Fsurveys helped it to understand how
OL,20,Fwildlife used the area, including
OL,21,Fidentifying bat flight paths.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
